      <title>Trump's Kennedy Center Obsession Isn't Like His Other Vanity Projects</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-06/trump-s-kennedy-center-obsession-isn-t-like-his-other-vanity-projects</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">ddb4bc7b549ad98c41c34f9e</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 12:00:34 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>If President Donald Trump gets his way, the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts could once again have his name on it. This would be a desecration of a living memorial to a slain president, and yet another sign of Trump’s insatiable need for status, attention and recognition.</description>
